flowchart LR
    input[Window 收到輸入] --> capture{是否已捕捉滑鼠？}
    capture -- 否 --> hit[從 RootElement<br/>遞迴執行 hitTest]
    hit --> target[最深層的目標 Element]
    capture -- 是 --> listener[呼叫目標的 Listener]
    target --> listener
    listener --> bubble[沿 parent chain<br/>向上傳到 Window]
    listener -. stopPropagation .-> stop[停止向上傳遞]

    classDef step fill:#f4f6fb,stroke:#49566b,color:#111,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef decision fill:#fff9df,stroke:#806f27,color:#111,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef stop fill:#fff1f1,stroke:#995050,color:#111,stroke-width:1px;
    class input,hit,target,listener,bubble step;
    class capture decision;
    class stop stop;
